<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Aug official reserves up to S$104.27.</title>
<headline>Singapore Aug official reserves up to S$104.27.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official foreign reserves.</p>
<p>(in billions of Singapore dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>						     Aug	 July    Aug '95</p>
<p>    Total official reserves		104.27     102.90    94.76</p>
<p>    Gold and foreign exchange	    103.58     102.22    94.09</p>
<p>    Special drawing rights (million)   248.40     243.30    235.80</p>
<p>    Reserve Position in IMF (million)  434.50     434.50    430.30</p>
<p>Source: Monetary Authority of Singapore</p>
